# The commits the release builds into diagnosticar-hpo-recognizer and
# diagnosticar-model. GATEWAY_COMMIT also supplies the Dockerfile of
# diagnosticar-question-agent, whose code is pinned in question-agent.env.
#
# The gateway and GenPhenAI (MateAlv/diagnostic.ar-api) and the Spanish symptom
# recognizer (MateAlv/spanish-symptoms-recognizer, a private copy of
# GMBUST-FIUBA's) live in other repositories. Pinning them here means a release
# tag names exactly one build of each, like the backend and frontend images;
# bump these to ship a new recognizer or GenPhenAI. GenPhenAI's model is pinned
# one level down, in the API's services/genphenai/model.lock.
#
# 9074e06: GenPhenAI serves model-v4.0.0, the v4 network with v4-layer on its
# logits, reading sex, age and onset (API #19); rr-v1 and ft-v1.1 are gone.
GATEWAY_COMMIT=9074e06d30c2c098fb81343e26b9253382c889ab
RECOGNIZER_COMMIT=651818b55e201738e49ce03f296108af24bfc18a
